#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Install the opt-in, source-only Pocket TTS conversion closure.

The release image carries this small installer, not llama.cpp source, Python
inference packages, model weights, voices, or generated GGUF files.  On an
explicit invocation it downloads one immutable llama.cpp source archive from
GitHub, verifies its exact byte identity, extracts only the files needed by the
Pocket converter, and publishes a root-controlled wrapper.

The independently selected model installer remains responsible for obtaining
model bytes directly from its approved upstream and for verifying both inputs
and locally derived outputs.  This helper never downloads model artifacts.
"""

